    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE PRESCRIPTION ORDINANCE (CHAPTER 68)",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      255.65,
      401.89,
      279.95
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      294.65,
      401.86,
      344.99
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Prescription(Amendment) Act, No. of 2019 and shall come intooperation on such date as the Minister may appoint by Orderpublished in the Gazette.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      359.57,
      401.89,
      422.99
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 5 of the Prescription Ordinance (Chapter 68)is hereby amended by the substitution for all the words from\u201cwithin ten years from the expiration of such time,\u201d to theend of that section, of the words \u201cwithin ten years from thedate of giving notice to the debtor.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      435.89,
      401.9,
      459.23
    ],
    "text": "3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
